    <track>
      <title>Thomas Pie, Mobley ‎– What Are They Doing Up There Now? [USA, Gospel, Soul, Outsider] (197-): Ultra lo-fi and haunting outsider gospel soul. The flip of this and the other single I have by him make this song sound like it was recorded in a state of the art studio. Insanely murky and muffled.</title>
      <creator>The Horror Show</creator>
      <image>https://vintageobscura.net/yt_img/idTTF_saBsA.jpg</image>
      <album>The Horror Show</album>
    </track>
